<title>HONG KONG: Jet Air announces first interim results.</title>
<headline>Jet Air announces first interim results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Sept 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 7.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  1.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	nil</p>
<p>    Net			  14.45</p>
<p>    Turnover		   228.41</p>
<p>    Company name	     Jet Air International Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		January 23-28</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 February 5</p>
<p>NOTE - Jet Air provides international air and sea freight forwarding services. It was listed on the stock exchange on March 26, 1996.</p>
<p>It proposed a bonus issue of shares on the basis of one share for every one share held.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
